 01 EMPLOYEE-DETAILS.
      05 EMP-ID       PIC 9(5).
      05 EMP-NAME     PIC X(20)
      05 EMP-SALARY   PIC 9(7).

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COPYDEMO.
AUTHOR.JU.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

  COPY EMPLOYEE.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

  MOVE 10001 TO EMP-ID
  MOVE 'VIJAY' TO EMP-NAME
  MOVE 50000 TO EMP-SALARY

  DISPLAY 'EMPLOYEE DETAILS'
  DISPLAY 'ID      : ' EMP-ID
  DISPLAY 'NAME    : ' EMP-NAME
  DISPLAY 'SALARY  : ' EMP-SALARY
  STOP RUN.

           
